{"title":"[🤖Vibe Coding] 为了防止大家不知道，其实 muse 里面的托管浏览器是有两个网络出口环境的","link":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1260427#reply0","date":1795778956000,"content":"\n\t<p>一般情况下环境一是 Cloudflare 的机房 IP，比较藏，大概率访问 X 都会被禁；环境二都是美国当地的家庭宽带，IP 很干净，可以用来过一些带 CF 盾或者对 IP 要求比较高的站点。</p>\n<p>有些还是星链的地址，纯净度很高。可以合理利用。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/media/d745b370162b62db67fab10e292e3f7cfcafe18272b5c74d545639e734d8391e.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/media/d745b370162b62db67fab10e292e3f7cfcafe18272b5c74d545639e734d8391e.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/media/d9f584b3fe2ef100d96a73b66e98f122850b642b264e8598db751dc944338698.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/media/d9f584b3fe2ef100d96a73b66e98f122850b642b264e8598db751dc944338698.jpg\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/media/9bf07669dfb3e581299e42b96a9dd58ead44014b33f85c820eb1b743d8bf80b6.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/media/9bf07669dfb3e581299e42b96a9dd58ead44014b33f85c820eb1b743d8bf80b6.jpg\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/media/b64e1ca61eed703e6f73e760012514bec351a634d70f373e858ff1c49eab6f2a.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/media/b64e1ca61eed703e6f73e760012514bec351a634d70f373e858ff1c49eab6f2a.jpg\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/media/bcb310869dc5b9fb481da58d09920070d595a5f17181e19fb8c12a22de2c6bf9.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/media/bcb310869dc5b9fb481da58d09920070d595a5f17181e19fb8c12a22de2c6bf9.jpg\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/media/d990704529529efd6dc021e4c9b62ee529b2622202c5fdd78fd573f2cbc36a0d.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/media/d990704529529efd6dc021e4c9b62ee529b2622202c5fdd78fd573f2cbc36a0d.jpg\" /></a></p>\n\n\t","author":"Tink","siteTitle":"V2EX","siteHash":"3e860ec03da35d802da530ce9241dfb35d861748393acba05f4337a7da1627c0","entryHash":"1ef0688b93b3a87f568116164a24c8ea46b0da34f023bb01ab0b6473c3fc569a","category":"IT 科技"}